flowchart LR
  Sources[Auth / API / AI / payment / marketplace sources] --> Normalize[Privacy-safe normalization]
  Normalize --> Checkpoint[Failure + checkpoint controls]
  Normalize --> Detect[Rule evaluation]
  Detect --> Alert[Deduplicated alert]
  Alert --> Case[Incident case]
  Case --> Playbook[Versioned playbook]
  Playbook --> Approval[Independent scoped approval]
  Approval --> Execute[Reversible execution]
  Execute --> Audit[Sanitized execution audit]
  Execute --> Rollback[Separately authorized rollback]
